        <detaileddescription>
<para>Export HSM security metrics in Prometheus text format</para>
<para>Metrics exported:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>hsm_security_stub_active: Gauge (0 = secure, 1 = stub active)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>hsm_security_warnings_total: Counter (cumulative warnings)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>hsm_provider_type: Info metric (provider type label)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>hsm_provider_ready: Gauge (0 = not ready, 1 = ready)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
